# Build context for chatgpt/Dockerfile (the ChatGPT plugin server), run from this repo root.
# Secrets never enter the image — in ANY folder (functions/.env holds the app's server keys).
**/.env*
**/*adminsdk*.json
**/*service-account*.json
# Not needed to build the server.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test-artifacts
**/*.log
functions
memory
docs
extracted
tmpclaude-*
wodi_store_launch_pack
*.pdf
